	(descr "QingPu WQP-PJ301M-12 3.5 mm mono switched jack, vertical, PCB mount - the original Thonkiconn. Same land pattern as the PJ398SM (T -4.92, TN +3.38, S +6.48 about the barrel axis) with slotted holes; only the 3D model differs. Pads T, TN, S. Imported from clacktronics/AudioJacks (github.com/clacktronics/AudioJacks, rev 14a8886, MIT, (c) 2021 Barwise - see doc/AudioJacks-LICENSE.txt). Land pattern unchanged from upstream, which lists it as UNTESTED: check against the part before fabbing.")
